This is a great step forward for your project. To implement this, I have updated the `dbService.ts` to send data to a Google Sheet and refined `App.tsx` to ensure that even your voice-to-text conversations are captured and logged.

### How to set up your Backend (Google Sheet)

1.  **Create a Google Sheet**: Open [sheets.new](https://sheets.new) and name it "Udyog Saheli Logs".
2.  **Open Apps Script**: Go to **Extensions** > **Apps Script**.
3.  **Paste the Code**: Delete any existing code and paste this:
    ```javascript
    function doPost(e) {
      var ss = SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSpreadsheet();
      var data = JSON.parse(e.postData.contents);
      var sheetName = data.type === 'PROFILE' ? "Profiles" : "ChatLogs";
      var sheet = ss.getSheetByName(sheetName) || ss.insertSheet(sheetName);

      if (sheet.getLastRow() === 0) {
        if (data.type === 'PROFILE') sheet.appendRow(["Time", "Name", "Mobile", "Village", "State"]);
        else sheet.appendRow(["Time", "User_ID", "Role", "Message"]);
      }

      if (data.type === 'PROFILE') {
        sheet.appendRow([new Date(), data.data.name, data.data.mobile, data.data.village, data.data.state]);
      } else {
        sheet.appendRow([new Date(), data.data.userId, data.data.role, data.data.text]);
      }
      return ContentService.createTextOutput("OK").setMimeType(ContentService.MimeType.TEXT);
    }
    ```
4.  **Deploy**: 
    *   Click **Deploy** > **New Deployment**.
    *   Select **Type**: "Web App".
    *   **Execute as**: "Me".
    *   **Who has access**: "Anyone".
    *   Click **Deploy** and **Copy the Web App URL**.
5.  **Update the App**: Paste that URL into the `SHEET_SCRIPT_URL` variable in `services/dbService.ts` (shown below).

